      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "largeheadline": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:21:26 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line1": "<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"></span><span class=\"fontsize-3vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Medical device reprocessing</span></span></span></span>",
          "line2": "<p>Medical device reprocessing adds value to hospitals by aligning with their internal goals. As the trusted supplier of choice for roughly 3,500 U.S. hos­pitals, including nearly all of U.S. News &amp; World Report’s “Best Hospitals,” our approach is simple: quality first, savings always. In 2023, Stryker's Sustainability Solutions helped their customers divert more than 5 million pounds of waste from the landfill through our reprocessing programs, saving 3,250 customers approximately $238 million. In the last five years, we have helped nearly 50 Integrated Delivery Networks save over $1 million annually in supply chain costs. </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Stryker’s Sustainability Solutions OnTrack program management provides custom solutions to optimize financial and environmental sustainability. Reprocessing success requires a focus on all the critical savings performance drivers: culture, contracting, clinical engagement, purchasing/logistics, staff awareness and education. Our OnTrack program management provides our customers with a true partnership to achieve those goals. </p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 27 2024 18:13:34 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,1)",
          "textIsRich": [
            "true",
            "true"
          ]
        },
