        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:27:27 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Inspection&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Once rebuilt, devices are inspected and function tested based on validated processes. Most devices are then sterilized, repackaged,&nbsp; labeled and shipped back to the customer.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 24 2023 18:45:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:33:34 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "inspection image",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sustainability/reprocessing-and-remanufacturing-/images/purchasing.jpg",
          "borderColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:41:21 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:27:27 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><b><span class=\"futura-bold\">Purchasing&nbsp;</span></b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Hospitals can monitor how many devices we have collected and are available to buy-back through our repaid return order generation process. Based on this, they order what they need from reprocessed inventories, before they order devices from the original manufacturer – this decreases purchasing costs.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 24 2023 18:47:08 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:33:34 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "inspection image",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sustainability/reprocessing-and-remanufacturing-/images/receiving image.jpg",
          "borderColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:42:21 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e2eca0ceb5@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:27:27 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Receiving&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Devices are shipped in original manufacturer case quantities to hospitals in clearly marked boxes and placed in the supply room next to original manufacturer devices. When pulling devices for cases, most of our customers pull reprocessed devices before selecting new ones so they can realize critical savings.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 16 2023 16:33:11 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
